(4716042, 679548, 5746, '<td valign="top">They look as if they are dissolving in water. Somehow I like the way this picture leaves something to the viewer''s imagination. I think more breathing space could add to the picture, but probably you had good reason to crop it this way. Great shadows of blue here. The dappled light also caught in a nice way. I like the water movement.</td>', 'They look as if they are dissolving in water. Somehow I like the way this picture leaves something to the viewer''s imagination. I think more breathing space could add to the picture, but probably you had good reason to crop it this way. Great shadows of blue here. The dappled light also caught in a nice way. I like the water movement.', '2008-05-21 19:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4716051, 679244, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice catch :) The little things in the foreground could be in focus as well to make the message more clear.</td>', 'Nice catch :) The little things in the foreground could be in focus as well to make the message more clear.', '2008-05-21 19:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
