(4716057, 680096, 5746, '<td valign="top">She is so pale :) I like the natural feel of this picture. I wish the colours were more vibrant. Probably you took this picture in the middle of the day. I would try evening light. It''s more flattering to the people as well as to the plants :)</td>', 'She is so pale :) I like the natural feel of this picture. I wish the colours were more vibrant. Probably you took this picture in the middle of the day. I would try evening light. It''s more flattering to the people as well as to the plants :)', '2008-05-21 19:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4716058, 680137, 5746, '<td valign="top">It''s probably difficult to look relaxed under water. This model looks quite stressed. Good and unusual idea. Dappled light under water is always interesting. Beautiful model, but I''m holding my breath looking at it.</td>', 'It''s probably difficult to look relaxed under water. This model looks quite stressed. Good and unusual idea. Dappled light under water is always interesting. Beautiful model, but I''m holding my breath looking at it.', '2008-05-21 20:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4716062, 678784, 5746, '<td valign="top">I can''t see dappled light. It looks even. Nice idea of posing the models this way, but her hip is in a strange place (very high). I don''t think it flatters beautiful model. I like the colours and particulafry the light on the male model clothes. Sharp.</td>', 'I can''t see dappled light. It looks even. Nice idea of posing the models this way, but her hip is in a strange place (very high). I don''t think it flatters beautiful model. I like the colours and particulafry the light on the male model clothes. Sharp.', '2008-05-21 20:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4716063, 679498, 5746, '<td valign="top">Everything is soft in this picture (camera shake?). This blur would add to the picture if her pose wasn''t so static. BTW she reminds me Liv Tyler in Lord of the Rings :)</td>', 'Everything is soft in this picture (camera shake?). This blur would add to the picture if her pose wasn''t so static. BTW she reminds me Liv Tyler in Lord of the Rings :)', '2008-05-21 20:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
