(4717114, 679839, 18073, '<td valign="top">The image meets the challenge nicely, but for me the compositon lets the photo down a little.  I think its the angle of the dove that I find ''jarring'', it just looks a little awkward.  There may well have been potential here, but I think the composition just lets it down.  Good effort all the same though!</td>', 'The image meets the challenge nicely, but for me the compositon lets the photo down a little.  I think its the angle of the dove that I find ''jarring'', it just looks a little awkward.  There may well have been potential here, but I think the composition just lets it down.  Good effort all the same though!', '2008-05-22 09:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717115, 679776, 18073, '<td valign="top">While there may well be dappled light here, the rest of the image fails for me.  The lack of any detail in the textures and lack of any real interest means that this image just doesn''t grab me in any way.  This is just my opinion of course and I am not sure what you were intending to portray.</td>', 'While there may well be dappled light here, the rest of the image fails for me.  The lack of any detail in the textures and lack of any real interest means that this image just doesn''t grab me in any way.  This is just my opinion of course and I am not sure what you were intending to portray.', '2008-05-22 09:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717125, 680131, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great colour and dappling!  I think it might work better if the subject was facing left insted of right - at the moment her direction seems to pull my eye to the right and out of the photo.  Over all very nice though.</td>', 'Great colour and dappling!  I think it might work better if the subject was facing left insted of right - at the moment her direction seems to pull my eye to the right and out of the photo.  Over all very nice though.', '2008-05-22 09:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
