(4717467, 679548, 92383, '<td valign="top">Sunshine through the rippled water would probably cause dappled light under the water.  We can''t see that though.  Looks like reflection of a hazy day on the water surface - not really the challenge to me.  Otherwise - the texture of the water is the most interesting thing to me.</td>', 'Sunshine through the rippled water would probably cause dappled light under the water.  We can''t see that though.  Looks like reflection of a hazy day on the water surface - not really the challenge to me.  Otherwise - the texture of the water is the most interesting thing to me.', '2008-05-22 13:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717470, 680087, 92383, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2008-05-22 13:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717474, 679551, 92383, '<td valign="top">I don''t see dappled light.  Your title fits though, and your image is nice.</td>', 'I don''t see dappled light.  Your title fits though, and your image is nice.', '2008-05-22 13:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717484, 680457, 92383, '<td valign="top">Not scoring based on this observation but I question something here.  I see the obvious dappled light, but it is treated as a shadow here.  Seems to me the dappled light here doesn''t "effect" the picture - it isn''t immersive enough in this case.  That being said, i am voting based on everything else, beside my impressions on the treatment of dappled light by your work here.  Cool title too.</td>', 'Not scoring based on this observation but I question something here.  I see the obvious dappled light, but it is treated as a shadow here.  Seems to me the dappled light here doesn''t "effect" the picture - it isn''t immersive enough in this case.  That being said, i am voting based on everything else, beside my impressions on the treatment of dappled light by your work here.  Cool title too.', '2008-05-22 13:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717488, 680142, 92383, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really good portrait and a wonderful exercise with dappled lighting - even in spite of the title.</td>', 'I think this is a really good portrait and a wonderful exercise with dappled lighting - even in spite of the title.', '2008-05-22 13:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717493, 678784, 92383, '<td valign="top">This is bizarre to me. Were you shooting for bizarre? Lot''s of lights but none cast dappled light that I see.</td>', 'This is bizarre to me. Were you shooting for bizarre? Lot''s of lights but none cast dappled light that I see.', '2008-05-22 13:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717495, 680227, 92383, '<td valign="top">I know basic but wow this looks like hdr.  It''s like the whole world was covered in dappled light that moment.</td>', 'I know basic but wow this looks like hdr.  It''s like the whole world was covered in dappled light that moment.', '2008-05-22 13:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717501, 680621, 92383, '<td valign="top">Surprized to see this light on the building.  Very nice.</td>', 'Surprized to see this light on the building.  Very nice.', '2008-05-22 13:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717503, 680503, 92383, '<td valign="top">Odd to see such a bush with modern standards of hygiene. :) j/k wonderful photo.</td>', 'Odd to see such a bush with modern standards of hygiene. :) j/k wonderful photo.', '2008-05-22 13:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717505, 679416, 92383, '<td valign="top">What breed of cat is this? - after the challenge is OK.  Nice photo.</td>', 'What breed of cat is this? - after the challenge is OK.  Nice photo.', '2008-05-22 13:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717509, 680215, 92383, '<td valign="top">This looks like a beautifully framed shot of no subject.</td>', 'This looks like a beautifully framed shot of no subject.', '2008-05-22 13:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717563, 679033, 5746, '<td valign="top">The contrast is very soft making the upper part of the image quite flat. Probably due to the harsh light during day. You could try to do it in the evening or early morning, or bump the contrast a bit to add some vibrance to the composition.</td>', 'The contrast is very soft making the upper part of the image quite flat. Probably due to the harsh light during day. You could try to do it in the evening or early morning, or bump the contrast a bit to add some vibrance to the composition.', '2008-05-22 14:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717569, 680215, 39679, '<td valign="top">I really like that you''ve managed to capture the softness of the foggy background yet the direct, almost harsh, light on the rocks.</td>', 'I really like that you''ve managed to capture the softness of the foggy background yet the direct, almost harsh, light on the rocks.', '2008-05-22 14:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717571, 679161, 39679, '<td valign="top">Wow...lots of baby duck pictures.  It must be spring!</td>', 'Wow...lots of baby duck pictures.  It must be spring!', '2008-05-22 14:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717572, 680620, 5746, '<td valign="top">So... I like the composition and the story behind, which every viewer has to discover on its own. Is the light dappled? I''m not sure. Looks even, just reflected from the floor. I''m not judging it however on dappled light existance, as it is quite fresh attempt on the challenge theme comparing to majority entries.</td>', 'So... I like the composition and the story behind, which every viewer has to discover on its own. Is the light dappled? I''m not sure. Looks even, just reflected from the floor. I''m not judging it however on dappled light existance, as it is quite fresh attempt on the challenge theme comparing to majority entries.', '2008-05-22 14:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717574, 679374, 5746, '<td valign="top">Oh... I think if the lizard was more in focus, instead of the tree it would''ve help this picture a lot. Dappled light is barely visible, but the detail in lizard''s head is very, very good. Also the tree texture, however it is more prominent than the main subject.</td>', 'Oh... I think if the lizard was more in focus, instead of the tree it would''ve help this picture a lot. Dappled light is barely visible, but the detail in lizard''s head is very, very good. Also the tree texture, however it is more prominent than the main subject.', '2008-05-22 14:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717580, 680324, 5746, '<td valign="top">I think you are intentionally aiming for 1. Well.. there is a dapple of light.</td>', 'I think you are intentionally aiming for 1. Well.. there is a dapple of light.', '2008-05-22 14:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717583, 679776, 39679, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  It''s one of the few images, in this challenge, that doesn''t look like it was made just for the "Dappled Light" challenge.  The lighting seems very natural.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  It''s one of the few images, in this challenge, that doesn''t look like it was made just for the "Dappled Light" challenge.  The lighting seems very natural.', '2008-05-22 14:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717585, 679460, 5746, '<td valign="top">Dappled Cat in dappled light. Nice detail, good composition. A bit clishe, but I can imagine, how tempting it is to make another portrait of your favourite model :)</td>', 'Dappled Cat in dappled light. Nice detail, good composition. A bit clishe, but I can imagine, how tempting it is to make another portrait of your favourite model :)', '2008-05-22 14:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717587, 680412, 39679, '<td valign="top">The greens of the plants seem a bit over-saturated but the waterfall color is beautiful.  Also, you''ve done a really good job of picking a great shutter speed.  The water on the rocks is softened but the rest of the waterfall looks clean.</td>', 'The greens of the plants seem a bit over-saturated but the waterfall color is beautiful.  Also, you''ve done a really good job of picking a great shutter speed.  The water on the rocks is softened but the rest of the waterfall looks clean.', '2008-05-22 14:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717588, 679928, 39679, '<td valign="top">Good eye to see this shot.  It''s one that many people would have just walked past.</td>', 'Good eye to see this shot.  It''s one that many people would have just walked past.', '2008-05-22 14:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717600, 680610, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I guess dappled light is difficult to shoot portraits in. Very nice details of her face. The smile wrinkles are clearly visible, making the model look interesting and so natural. She looks like a lovely lady. I would only ask her to move the hair on her right a bit behind, as she''s got unpleasant shadow around her eye (I know - it''s a dapple ;)). The big blue spot on her right is driving my attention from her shining eyes.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I guess dappled light is difficult to shoot portraits in. Very nice details of her face. The smile wrinkles are clearly visible, making the model look interesting and so natural. She looks like a lovely lady. I would only ask her to move the hair on her right a bit behind, as she''s got unpleasant shadow around her eye (I know - it''s a dapple ;)). The big blue spot on her right is driving my attention from her shining eyes.', '2008-05-22 14:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717610, 679454, 39679, '<td valign="top">Great decision to include the tree in the foreground.  Not only does it drive the viewer''s eye to your subject but it also adds a nice sense if depth to your image.</td>', 'Great decision to include the tree in the foreground.  Not only does it drive the viewer''s eye to your subject but it also adds a nice sense if depth to your image.', '2008-05-22 14:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717616, 680272, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot and almost looks like a candid shot with your model''s neutral expression.</td>', 'This is a nice shot and almost looks like a candid shot with your model''s neutral expression.', '2008-05-22 14:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717618, 680466, 39679, '<td valign="top">This has a snapshot quality that I like.  The "fogging" from the light really adds to that feeling.</td>', 'This has a snapshot quality that I like.  The "fogging" from the light really adds to that feeling.', '2008-05-22 14:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717620, 680036, 39679, '<td valign="top">This really makes me feel the relaxed feel of a spring morning.  That said, there are a lot of elements in this shot that distract the viewer''s eye from your subject.  The hanging basket in the foreground, the vacant chair on the photographer''s right as well as the play house all draw the eye from the subject.</td>', 'This really makes me feel the relaxed feel of a spring morning.  That said, there are a lot of elements in this shot that distract the viewer''s eye from your subject.  The hanging basket in the foreground, the vacant chair on the photographer''s right as well as the play house all draw the eye from the subject.', '2008-05-22 14:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717622, 680176, 39679, '<td valign="top">This shot works well in B&amp;W but I wonder if, in this case, the color version might have brought another dimension to the image.</td>', 'This shot works well in B&W but I wonder if, in this case, the color version might have brought another dimension to the image.', '2008-05-22 14:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717625, 678783, 39679, '<td valign="top">Really well saturated colors!  it''s always tempting to overdo colors in post production but in your case, you''ve controlled the intensity very well</td>', 'Really well saturated colors!  it''s always tempting to overdo colors in post production but in your case, you''ve controlled the intensity very well', '2008-05-22 14:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717628, 679888, 39679, '<td valign="top">The colors in your shot are great but the extreme density breaks up the image so that it''s hard to find a subject.</td>', 'The colors in your shot are great but the extreme density breaks up the image so that it''s hard to find a subject.', '2008-05-22 14:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717631, 679498, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Using the a soft focus filter adds a great dreamy feel to this shot and muting the colors so that your subject stands out against the dark background was a great call.  All that said, it seems that the trees and your model all lean to photographer''s right but the ground is level.  Perhaps the shot was taken on a slight incline?</td>', 'Nicely done.  Using the a soft focus filter adds a great dreamy feel to this shot and muting the colors so that your subject stands out against the dark background was a great call.  All that said, it seems that the trees and your model all lean to photographer''s right but the ground is level.  Perhaps the shot was taken on a slight incline?', '2008-05-22 14:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717656, 680679, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between the light, curved foreground and dark straight background.  Nice ro see some architecture in amongst all the dappled forest pics too!  Well done.</td>', 'Great contrast between the light, curved foreground and dark straight background.  Nice ro see some architecture in amongst all the dappled forest pics too!  Well done.', '2008-05-22 15:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717658, 679184, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and repetition of form.</td>', 'Nice texture and repetition of form.', '2008-05-22 15:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717660, 680411, 53416, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and nice shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Interesting lighting and nice shallow depth of field.', '2008-05-22 15:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717661, 680448, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and detail!</td>', 'Great lighting and detail!', '2008-05-22 15:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717663, 680272, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, nicely composed and with a good blurry background.  This is very nice.</td>', 'Great portrait, nicely composed and with a good blurry background.  This is very nice.', '2008-05-22 15:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717664, 680501, 53416, '<td valign="top">What a unique photograph - most people would have the head in focus!  Great shallow depth of field.</td>', 'What a unique photograph - most people would have the head in focus!  Great shallow depth of field.', '2008-05-22 15:18:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4717666, 680057, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good dappled light.</td>', 'Nice composition and good dappled light.', '2008-05-22 15:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717667, 680625, 53416, '<td valign="top">Awww, isn''t he cute!  Great pose, but I''d like his nose to be a bit more in focus.</td>', 'Awww, isn''t he cute!  Great pose, but I''d like his nose to be a bit more in focus.', '2008-05-22 15:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717669, 679199, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, but not quite dappled enough for me.</td>', 'Nice colours, but not quite dappled enough for me.', '2008-05-22 15:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717671, 679697, 53416, '<td valign="top">I like how the main flower is highlighted by the dplling.  Good contrast and colour too.</td>', 'I like how the main flower is highlighted by the dplling.  Good contrast and colour too.', '2008-05-22 15:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717672, 680142, 53416, '<td valign="top">I love the patterns formed by the light on her face!  Also make me onder what she''s gazing at....?</td>', 'I love the patterns formed by the light on her face!  Also make me onder what she''s gazing at....?', '2008-05-22 15:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717673, 680380, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great form, composition, texture and contrast.  Really very nice indeed!  One of my pics of the competition.  Well done!</td>', 'Great form, composition, texture and contrast.  Really very nice indeed!  One of my pics of the competition.  Well done!', '2008-05-22 15:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717675, 680441, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice dappling and good colour.  Wish there was some sort of main focal point hough...?</td>', 'Nice dappling and good colour.  Wish there was some sort of main focal point hough...?', '2008-05-22 15:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717677, 679674, 53416, '<td valign="top">Very busy, and lots to look at, but it works for me!  The lighting is really very good, withthe full range of highlights to shadows well captured.  Well done!</td>', 'Very busy, and lots to look at, but it works for me!  The lighting is really very good, withthe full range of highlights to shadows well captured.  Well done!', '2008-05-22 15:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717678, 680050, 53416, '<td valign="top">An interesting portrait, nicely composed and with good texture.</td>', 'An interesting portrait, nicely composed and with good texture.', '2008-05-22 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717681, 680605, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the rules of thirds, and I love the shadow cast by the flower.  I wonder if this might work better with the flower facing ''into'' the pic (i.e. to the right)....?</td>', 'Nice use of the rules of thirds, and I love the shadow cast by the flower.  I wonder if this might work better with the flower facing ''into'' the pic (i.e. to the right)....?', '2008-05-22 15:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717682, 679760, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great colour and contrast with very interesting dappling.  Nice.</td>', 'Great colour and contrast with very interesting dappling.  Nice.', '2008-05-22 15:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717683, 680571, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great textures and colour.</td>', 'Great textures and colour.', '2008-05-22 15:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717685, 680087, 53416, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed!  I love the light, composition, colours and the very moody sky.  Well done!!</td>', 'Very nice indeed!  I love the light, composition, colours and the very moody sky.  Well done!!', '2008-05-22 15:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717686, 680478, 18073, '<td valign="top">The image is just way to soft, you need to take more care with your focusing</td>', 'The image is just way to soft, you need to take more care with your focusing', '2008-05-22 15:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717688, 679878, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice background and interesting lighting, but feel the composition is a bit too central?</td>', 'Nice background and interesting lighting, but feel the composition is a bit too central?', '2008-05-22 15:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717689, 680609, 33161, '<td valign="top">Early morning light and fog really would have made this good.</td>', 'Early morning light and fog really would have made this good.', '2008-05-22 15:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717690, 679524, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good contrast.  I wonder what he''s looking at?  Well done.</td>', 'Nice composition and good contrast.  I wonder what he''s looking at?  Well done.', '2008-05-22 15:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717691, 680450, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and good dappling.</td>', 'Nice colours and good dappling.', '2008-05-22 15:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717693, 680448, 33161, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting</td>', 'Nice lighting', '2008-05-22 15:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717694, 680469, 53416, '<td valign="top">Sharp, nicely composed and with interesting texture in the tree.  Well done.</td>', 'Sharp, nicely composed and with interesting texture in the tree.  Well done.', '2008-05-22 15:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717695, 679646, 53416, '<td valign="top">Good colours and great background bokeh.</td>', 'Good colours and great background bokeh.', '2008-05-22 15:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717699, 679878, 33161, '<td valign="top">Good photo, I would have cropped more of the top off.</td>', 'Good photo, I would have cropped more of the top off.', '2008-05-22 15:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717700, 680479, 53416, '<td valign="top">Awww, isn''t he cute!  Great colours and nice sharp focus on the chick.  I feel the tub of feed is distracting though.....</td>', 'Awww, isn''t he cute!  Great colours and nice sharp focus on the chick.  I feel the tub of feed is distracting though.....', '2008-05-22 15:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717702, 679454, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great composition, depth of field and contrast.  Very nice indeed!!!</td>', 'Great composition, depth of field and contrast.  Very nice indeed!!!', '2008-05-22 15:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717704, 680079, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice colurs.</td>', 'Nice colurs.', '2008-05-22 15:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717705, 680422, 53416, '<td valign="top">Lacks any real focal point.</td>', 'Lacks any real focal point.', '2008-05-22 15:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717706, 679852, 53416, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting creating nice dappling.</td>', 'Interesting lighting creating nice dappling.', '2008-05-22 15:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717708, 680522, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, good composition and great dappling.  This is really very nice.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice depth of field, good composition and great dappling.  This is really very nice.  Well done!', '2008-05-22 15:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717710, 680475, 33161, '<td valign="top">I like your picture. Good colors.</td>', 'I like your picture. Good colors.', '2008-05-22 15:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717711, 679664, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - I love how the tyre and ropes just seem to glow.</td>', 'Nice lighting - I love how the tyre and ropes just seem to glow.', '2008-05-22 15:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717713, 680215, 61396, '<td valign="top">It is great how you used the problematic dappled light to your advantage. Good luck.</td>', 'It is great how you used the problematic dappled light to your advantage. Good luck.', '2008-05-22 15:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717714, 680433, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, but I think it could do with being a bit brighter....?</td>', 'Nice depth of field, but I think it could do with being a bit brighter....?', '2008-05-22 15:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717715, 679651, 33161, '<td valign="top">cant wait to see where this was taken.</td>', 'cant wait to see where this was taken.', '2008-05-22 15:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717717, 680365, 33161, '<td valign="top">Looks like my best friend.</td>', 'Looks like my best friend.', '2008-05-22 15:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717718, 680534, 53416, '<td valign="top">Plenty of detail and faces to look at.  Shame the pic is restricted to this size - must look much nicer larger...</td>', 'Plenty of detail and faces to look at.  Shame the pic is restricted to this size - must look much nicer larger...', '2008-05-22 15:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717720, 680156, 33161, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections.</td>', 'I like the reflections.', '2008-05-22 15:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717722, 680640, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great colour and the reflection is beautiful.  Doesn''t really say ''dappled light'' to me though.</td>', 'Great colour and the reflection is beautiful.  Doesn''t really say ''dappled light'' to me though.', '2008-05-22 15:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717723, 680546, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great colour and contrast, but a bit too centrally composed for me.</td>', 'Great colour and contrast, but a bit too centrally composed for me.', '2008-05-22 15:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717724, 679374, 61396, '<td valign="top">Dappled or not dappled, the lighting is great.</td>', 'Dappled or not dappled, the lighting is great.', '2008-05-22 15:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717725, 679548, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great colour, I love the blue!</td>', 'Great colour, I love the blue!', '2008-05-22 15:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717726, 680617, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great dappled lighting - the highlight over the eyes works very well!  Well done!</td>', 'Great dappled lighting - the highlight over the eyes works very well!  Well done!', '2008-05-22 15:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717727, 678783, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and reflections.</td>', 'Nice colours and reflections.', '2008-05-22 15:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717728, 679460, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great colour, depth of field and sharpness.  Nice!</td>', 'Great colour, depth of field and sharpness.  Nice!', '2008-05-22 15:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717730, 679822, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and contrast, but the composition doesn''t really work for me.</td>', 'Nice colour and contrast, but the composition doesn''t really work for me.', '2008-05-22 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717731, 680365, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, with good contrast and interesting lighting.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, with good contrast and interesting lighting.  Well done.', '2008-05-22 15:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717732, 680050, 61396, '<td valign="top">One can watch this picture for a very long time (an dI''m talking from experience)</td>', 'One can watch this picture for a very long time (an dI''m talking from experience)', '2008-05-22 15:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717733, 679259, 61396, '<td valign="top">Nice and smooth. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice and smooth. Good luck.', '2008-05-22 15:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717737, 678784, 61396, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to read the story behind this unusual scene.</td>', 'I can''t wait to read the story behind this unusual scene.', '2008-05-22 15:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717800, 680176, 5364, '<td valign="top">This is a really good idea, converting to monochrome.</td>', 'This is a really good idea, converting to monochrome.', '2008-05-22 16:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717908, 679522, 39679, '<td valign="top">Really nice warm lighting.  Also, I don''t know if it was intentional but having a "golden" theme really works well (yellow flowers, blond hair, warm light)</td>', 'Really nice warm lighting.  Also, I don''t know if it was intentional but having a "golden" theme really works well (yellow flowers, blond hair, warm light)', '2008-05-22 17:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717912, 680324, 39679, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I''m getting this.  Is this really a blurry picture of a picture?</td>', 'I''m not sure I''m getting this.  Is this really a blurry picture of a picture?', '2008-05-22 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717917, 679822, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and but the flowers in the background almost blend in with your subject.  You might have had a better shot if you''d have moved just a little to the left to get a darker background.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Nice colors and but the flowers in the background almost blend in with your subject.  You might have had a better shot if you''d have moved just a little to the left to get a darker background.  Just a thought.', '2008-05-22 17:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717921, 680494, 39679, '<td valign="top">Fireworks are about impossible to hand hold.  A tripod would have really helped you here.</td>', 'Fireworks are about impossible to hand hold.  A tripod would have really helped you here.', '2008-05-22 17:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717923, 680079, 39679, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors but you don''t really have a clear cut subject.  In shots like this it''s too easy to include too much.  I''d love to see you do this shot again but focusing on a small cluster of flowers rather than include so many.</td>', 'Beautiful colors but you don''t really have a clear cut subject.  In shots like this it''s too easy to include too much.  I''d love to see you do this shot again but focusing on a small cluster of flowers rather than include so many.', '2008-05-22 17:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717972, 680450, 39679, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of vertical objects in your shot which tends to take focus off of your subjects.</td>', 'There are a lot of vertical objects in your shot which tends to take focus off of your subjects.', '2008-05-22 17:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717977, 680617, 39679, '<td valign="top">I''m normally a huge proponent of good density but in this case it seems a bit overpowering...having nearly blown out whites and absolute blacks.  Other than that this is a really sweet shot.  I''d love to see it again with a little less contrast.  I think it''d be a wonderful shot.</td>', 'I''m normally a huge proponent of good density but in this case it seems a bit overpowering...having nearly blown out whites and absolute blacks.  Other than that this is a really sweet shot.  I''d love to see it again with a little less contrast.  I think it''d be a wonderful shot.', '2008-05-22 17:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717978, 680620, 39679, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the bars to frame your shot.  It really adds to the sense of depth in this image.</td>', 'Very nice use of the bars to frame your shot.  It really adds to the sense of depth in this image.', '2008-05-22 17:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717981, 680380, 39679, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The lighting you chose as well as some possible soft focus filtering really lends a sense of softness and calm to the shot.  I also really like that you chose to use B&amp;W.</td>', 'I love this shot.  The lighting you chose as well as some possible soft focus filtering really lends a sense of softness and calm to the shot.  I also really like that you chose to use B&W.', '2008-05-22 17:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717982, 679651, 39679, '<td valign="top">It looks like you were going for a morning light look (which you did) but the image seems really dark on my monitor.</td>', 'It looks like you were going for a morning light look (which you did) but the image seems really dark on my monitor.', '2008-05-22 17:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4717986, 680625, 39679, '<td valign="top">what a sneaky looking chipmunk.  Very cute shot.</td>', 'what a sneaky looking chipmunk.  Very cute shot.', '2008-05-22 17:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4718042, 679107, 39679, '<td valign="top">With the strong sunlight of mid-day, the contrast on your shot is really intense which makes the hen more difficult to see.  Post processing to reduce the contrast would definitely have helped.</td>', 'With the strong sunlight of mid-day, the contrast on your shot is really intense which makes the hen more difficult to see.  Post processing to reduce the contrast would definitely have helped.', '2008-05-22 18:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
