(4718986, 680332, 5746, '<td valign="top">You probably tried to focus on her injury to make the message more clear. However I think, it is clear enough, instead with people portraits it is always better to focus on their eyes. The idea is very good, picture tells a story, wakes up emotions (the first thought is "poor girl"). I would just try to focus on her eyes, instead of knee.</td>', 'You probably tried to focus on her injury to make the message more clear. However I think, it is clear enough, instead with people portraits it is always better to focus on their eyes. The idea is very good, picture tells a story, wakes up emotions (the first thought is "poor girl"). I would just try to focus on her eyes, instead of knee.', '2008-05-23 04:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4718990, 678739, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea but the visible blur will take away few points for sure. The negative space is interesting composition for this picture, but the background is too busy and uninteresting. It distracts from the guitar (?) neck. I would try maybe different perspective and use tripod for this kind of shot.</td>', 'Very nice idea but the visible blur will take away few points for sure. The negative space is interesting composition for this picture, but the background is too busy and uninteresting. It distracts from the guitar (?) neck. I would try maybe different perspective and use tripod for this kind of shot.', '2008-05-23 04:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4718995, 680537, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern. There are visible blown ups on the leaes, probably due to harsh lighting. Evening light would make the leaves colour more vibrant. God eye on detail, fill the frame is a good choice for this.</td>', 'Nice pattern. There are visible blown ups on the leaes, probably due to harsh lighting. Evening light would make the leaves colour more vibrant. God eye on detail, fill the frame is a good choice for this.', '2008-05-23 04:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4718996, 680433, 5746, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF makes me think "Where is the blue?" Forget-me-nots are lovely flowers, I would keep them in focus to add interest to the picture. Lovely greens, good composition, good quality.</td>', 'The shallow DOF makes me think "Where is the blue?" Forget-me-nots are lovely flowers, I would keep them in focus to add interest to the picture. Lovely greens, good composition, good quality.', '2008-05-23 04:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719000, 679852, 5746, '<td valign="top">She is beautiful model. Somehow I think the focus is on her brests. I would try to focus more on her eyes, as it is always essential in portraits. Lovely warm evening light. Good perspective, nice composition.</td>', 'She is beautiful model. Somehow I think the focus is on her brests. I would try to focus more on her eyes, as it is always essential in portraits. Lovely warm evening light. Good perspective, nice composition.', '2008-05-23 04:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719006, 680635, 5746, '<td valign="top">I have to look carefuly to find the path. Maybe making the stone steps a leading line and mre in the center of composition would make the subject more prominent. You could try to move a bit to the right.</td>', 'I have to look carefuly to find the path. Maybe making the stone steps a leading line and mre in the center of composition would make the subject more prominent. You could try to move a bit to the right.', '2008-05-23 05:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719010, 679888, 5746, '<td valign="top">The house looks very intersesting. The walls are full of dappled light. However, it is barely visible. I would try and crop the upper 1/3 of the picture which is not very attractive and doesn''t add to the picture IMHO. It would bring the house more. Also changing perspective a bit to the right would show more of the interesting texture of the walls. Great location, crisp colours, nice dappled light.</td>', 'The house looks very intersesting. The walls are full of dappled light. However, it is barely visible. I would try and crop the upper 1/3 of the picture which is not very attractive and doesn''t add to the picture IMHO. It would bring the house more. Also changing perspective a bit to the right would show more of the interesting texture of the walls. Great location, crisp colours, nice dappled light.', '2008-05-23 05:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719013, 679641, 5746, '<td valign="top">Wow, almost minimalistic. Just the background... It''s quite busy driving attention from the main subject. Maybe different perspective would help? Nevertheless great idea.</td>', 'Wow, almost minimalistic. Just the background... It''s quite busy driving attention from the main subject. Maybe different perspective would help? Nevertheless great idea.', '2008-05-23 05:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719016, 680625, 5746, '<td valign="top">Oh... how sweet :) I would try and focus on its eyes, despite the fact they are still half asleep ;) Looks like you focused on top of its head. Lovely colours, nice detail. Sweet creature. Very good attempt.</td>', 'Oh... how sweet :) I would try and focus on its eyes, despite the fact they are still half asleep ;) Looks like you focused on top of its head. Lovely colours, nice detail. Sweet creature. Very good attempt.', '2008-05-23 05:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719024, 679522, 5746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful portrait. It''s so natural and cute. Lucky girl to have someone as skilled as you are to make her pictures. Excellent quality and detail. It''s full of air. I like the fill light from the flowers on her face. The skintones are so natural. Lovely, lovely picture. <strike>9</strike>. Bumping it up to 10.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful portrait. It''s so natural and cute. Lucky girl to have someone as skilled as you are to make her pictures. Excellent quality and detail. It''s full of air. I like the fill light from the flowers on her face. The skintones are so natural. Lovely, lovely picture. 9. Bumping it up to 10.', '2008-05-23 05:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719025, 680384, 5746, '<td valign="top">Excellent. The leading line, the details of trees, leaves (also the one on the grund), the splash of red, I love everything about this picture. The rythm of wooden path brings in order and sense of tidiness. Bumping up to 10.</td>', 'Excellent. The leading line, the details of trees, leaves (also the one on the grund), the splash of red, I love everything about this picture. The rythm of wooden path brings in order and sense of tidiness. Bumping up to 10.', '2008-05-23 05:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719026, 679651, 5746, '<td valign="top">Oh wow... This one came unexpected. I like the way you shot this mountain from high level. Mountains are usually shot from down, making ordinary postcards out of the pictures. I love the subtle colour scheme and fantastic dappled light on the snow. Great idea to come out early morning for this shot. I like contrast with the dark hill on the right making the light more prominent. Excellent.</td>', 'Oh wow... This one came unexpected. I like the way you shot this mountain from high level. Mountains are usually shot from down, making ordinary postcards out of the pictures. I love the subtle colour scheme and fantastic dappled light on the snow. Great idea to come out early morning for this shot. I like contrast with the dark hill on the right making the light more prominent. Excellent.', '2008-05-23 05:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719027, 680215, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very misterious atmosphere. I like the way light falls from top and somehow sets and remains on the young leaves. Great composition. I think that maybe bigger DOF bringing details of smaler stones on the right would enhance it, but I love it the way it is.</td>', 'Very misterious atmosphere. I like the way light falls from top and somehow sets and remains on the young leaves. Great composition. I think that maybe bigger DOF bringing details of smaler stones on the right would enhance it, but I love it the way it is.', '2008-05-23 05:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719028, 680383, 5746, '<td valign="top">Is it real? OMG, it looks like an illustration, not a picture. Great composition. I love the grayscale you used, it gives it a mystic mood somehow. It''s sooo graphic. I simply love it. Bumping up to 10.</td>', 'Is it real? OMG, it looks like an illustration, not a picture. Great composition. I love the grayscale you used, it gives it a mystic mood somehow. It''s sooo graphic. I simply love it. Bumping up to 10.', '2008-05-23 05:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719029, 680469, 5746, '<td valign="top">What a detail... Very natural, very sweet portrait. I like the composition, the fact, that you choosed the tree branch for a location. It''s so appropriate. Great enviromental portrait. I like the colour scheme. Dappled light dosen''t overburden the main subject. Great :)</td>', 'What a detail... Very natural, very sweet portrait. I like the composition, the fact, that you choosed the tree branch for a location. It''s so appropriate. Great enviromental portrait. I like the colour scheme. Dappled light dosen''t overburden the main subject. Great :)', '2008-05-23 05:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719030, 680466, 5746, '<td valign="top">At first I wanted to say its softness disturbs. Now, I think it adds to the picture a retro and nostalgic feel. It is one of these pictures, where you can''t tell when it was made, what year, which century. It leaves a lot to viewer imagination. I like it a lot.</td>', 'At first I wanted to say its softness disturbs. Now, I think it adds to the picture a retro and nostalgic feel. It is one of these pictures, where you can''t tell when it was made, what year, which century. It leaves a lot to viewer imagination. I like it a lot.', '2008-05-23 05:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719031, 680365, 5746, '<td valign="top">Oh my.... Great portrait. Perfectly focused on its eyes. Great hair detail. Nice DOF. Very well cropped. Dappled light used to enhance the mood. I love the dog expression, particuraly the way it shows its teeth. It''s a real guardian, no doubt. I like B&amp;W choice as it brings out more detail. Unfortunately I think it may suffer since DPC likes crisp and vibrant colours. Bumping up to 9.</td>', 'Oh my.... Great portrait. Perfectly focused on its eyes. Great hair detail. Nice DOF. Very well cropped. Dappled light used to enhance the mood. I love the dog expression, particuraly the way it shows its teeth. It''s a real guardian, no doubt. I like B&W choice as it brings out more detail. Unfortunately I think it may suffer since DPC likes crisp and vibrant colours. Bumping up to 9.', '2008-05-23 05:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719032, 680380, 5746, '<td valign="top">Unusual shape. Well... I would say it is quite erotic ;) Very elegant. B&amp;W suits it. I also like diagonal composition. I would try to use bigger DOF to catch the detail on the far end of the flower to enhance it''s definition. Very nice entry.</td>', 'Unusual shape. Well... I would say it is quite erotic ;) Very elegant. B&W suits it. I also like diagonal composition. I would try to use bigger DOF to catch the detail on the far end of the flower to enhance it''s definition. Very nice entry.', '2008-05-23 05:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719033, 679839, 5746, '<td valign="top">Subtle colour scheme, not very DPC. I would tilt it a bit to the right to make themain subject horizontal. I think it would enhance coposition. Beautiful detail. Nice dappled light.</td>', 'Subtle colour scheme, not very DPC. I would tilt it a bit to the right to make themain subject horizontal. I think it would enhance coposition. Beautiful detail. Nice dappled light.', '2008-05-23 05:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719034, 680050, 5746, '<td valign="top">The flower in his mouth looks crazy :) I like the fresh idea and the execution is great.</td>', 'The flower in his mouth looks crazy :) I like the fresh idea and the execution is great.', '2008-05-23 05:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719035, 679776, 5746, '<td valign="top">It took me a while searching for the main subject before I discovered I''m looking at it :) I like the original attempt on the challenge theme. I like B&amp;W also. It makes the picture a retro feel. Different textures also make the picture interesting. Definately something that leaves a lot to viewer imagination.</td>', 'It took me a while searching for the main subject before I discovered I''m looking at it :) I like the original attempt on the challenge theme. I like B&W also. It makes the picture a retro feel. Different textures also make the picture interesting. Definately something that leaves a lot to viewer imagination.', '2008-05-23 05:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719036, 680479, 5746, '<td valign="top">Dapple light is very subtle here. However cute model, nice colour scheme and carefuly arranged composition make this picture stand out.</td>', 'Dapple light is very subtle here. However cute model, nice colour scheme and carefuly arranged composition make this picture stand out.', '2008-05-23 05:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719037, 680609, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and very vibrant. I wish DPC allowed bigger sizes as this kind of pictures can be judged fairly only in their full size.</td>', 'Nice composition and very vibrant. I wish DPC allowed bigger sizes as this kind of pictures can be judged fairly only in their full size.', '2008-05-23 05:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719038, 680087, 5746, '<td valign="top">I alwyas liked infrared pictures. Scenery like from a child''s fairytale. Nice detail, well caught dappled light.</td>', 'I alwyas liked infrared pictures. Scenery like from a child''s fairytale. Nice detail, well caught dappled light.', '2008-05-23 05:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719039, 680605, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very clear and elegant. I like the composition, however the "horizon" is very close to the middle of the picture. Good decision to shoot the flower from this level.</td>', 'Very clear and elegant. I like the composition, however the "horizon" is very close to the middle of the picture. Good decision to shoot the flower from this level.', '2008-05-23 05:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719040, 679929, 5746, '<td valign="top">Wow, lovely detal. Great model. The sky is boring, but with this kind of colourful object it makes a perfect background. I like the way you focused on its eyes. Good composition. Very, very nice.</td>', 'Wow, lovely detal. Great model. The sky is boring, but with this kind of colourful object it makes a perfect background. I like the way you focused on its eyes. Good composition. Very, very nice.', '2008-05-23 05:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719042, 679158, 5746, '<td valign="top">God knows what is it, but it works. Probably there is something happening below the picture, which you didn''t want to show, but it screams to show the full shape. Lovely colours. It looks a bit soft, but may be my LCD as well.</td>', 'God knows what is it, but it works. Probably there is something happening below the picture, which you didn''t want to show, but it screams to show the full shape. Lovely colours. It looks a bit soft, but may be my LCD as well.', '2008-05-23 05:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719043, 680227, 5746, '<td valign="top">It looks like painting. The right part is far more interesting due to the light. I would shift a bit to the right. Some details are lost but it may be also due to the small DPC size allowed. Landscapes are always best to judge in the full view.</td>', 'It looks like painting. The right part is far more interesting due to the light. I would shift a bit to the right. Some details are lost but it may be also due to the small DPC size allowed. Landscapes are always best to judge in the full view.', '2008-05-23 05:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719044, 679539, 5746, '<td valign="top">Or5iginal attepmpt. I think you could show the model eyes, and avoid cutting humans at their joints (wrest in this case). It would''ve make a great story and enhance the composition. I like the background and dappled light use. Good contrast and sharpness.</td>', 'Or5iginal attepmpt. I think you could show the model eyes, and avoid cutting humans at their joints (wrest in this case). It would''ve make a great story and enhance the composition. I like the background and dappled light use. Good contrast and sharpness.', '2008-05-23 05:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719045, 680523, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great capture of dappled light in a close up (probably even more difficult, than in a landscape). Excellent detail. Interesting shape. Nice colour scheme.</td>', 'Great capture of dappled light in a close up (probably even more difficult, than in a landscape). Excellent detail. Interesting shape. Nice colour scheme.', '2008-05-23 05:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719046, 680607, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very high contrast. Almost dutone. I like the way you used this wooden construction.</td>', 'Very high contrast. Almost dutone. I like the way you used this wooden construction.', '2008-05-23 05:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719048, 680149, 5746, '<td valign="top">Where are the books? I like the idea. The view through the window is a bit too busy. Shallower depth of field, would''ve add to the image IMHO. I like the composition and B&amp;W was a good choice.</td>', 'Where are the books? I like the idea. The view through the window is a bit too busy. Shallower depth of field, would''ve add to the image IMHO. I like the composition and B&W was a good choice.', '2008-05-23 05:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719049, 680617, 5746, '<td valign="top">I thought of that too, however my skills are still minimal. Lovely portrait. It wakes up such warm emotions. I like the colour scheme and composition. Very natural. Very beautiful.</td>', 'I thought of that too, however my skills are still minimal. Lovely portrait. It wakes up such warm emotions. I like the colour scheme and composition. Very natural. Very beautiful.', '2008-05-23 05:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719050, 680679, 5746, '<td valign="top">Razor sharp. B&amp;W was a very good choice as it reveals more detail. I would like to see more of it and less of the background. Maybe centered composition would''ve been better? I don''t know. I like the technical perfection and your eye for the detail.</td>', 'Razor sharp. B&W was a very good choice as it reveals more detail. I would like to see more of it and less of the background. Maybe centered composition would''ve been better? I don''t know. I like the technical perfection and your eye for the detail.', '2008-05-23 05:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719051, 680131, 5746, '<td valign="top">I love this composition. Great model. The colour shift makes it look more like a painting. Bumping up.</td>', 'I love this composition. Great model. The colour shift makes it look more like a painting. Bumping up.', '2008-05-23 05:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719052, 680057, 5746, '<td valign="top">Almost 3D. Nice detail, good composition. Lovely portrait. With this kind of animal portrait it is always good to leave some space to the direction the animal is moving. I would leave more space on its left to give the picture more air. Very nice entry.</td>', 'Almost 3D. Nice detail, good composition. Lovely portrait. With this kind of animal portrait it is always good to leave some space to the direction the animal is moving. I would leave more space on its left to give the picture more air. Very nice entry.', '2008-05-23 05:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4719101, 680380, 39850, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, looks like an orchid bud.  Tones work well.  Can''t help wonder about it not cropped so tight on the right.  Nice unique image.  Nice light too.</td>', 'Interesting image, looks like an orchid bud.  Tones work well.  Can''t help wonder about it not cropped so tight on the right.  Nice unique image.  Nice light too.', '2008-05-23 07:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
