(4720505, 680503, 89669, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo! I would like to see a little more contrast between the lion and the back ground, but that is just my personal taste. Didi you try ti crop in on his face at all. there seems to be some nice dappled light from his front paw to the tip of his head.</td>', 'This is a great photo! I would like to see a little more contrast between the lion and the back ground, but that is just my personal taste. Didi you try ti crop in on his face at all. there seems to be some nice dappled light from his front paw to the tip of his head.', '2008-05-23 20:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4720534, 680227, 36006, '<td valign="top">To me, this image stands out among the rest.<br/> <br/>The dappled light is obvious, but what stands out are the clouds, and the reflection off the water of the clouds, with the jungle in the center giving an eerie feeling of floating among those clouds.<br/> <br/>Good light, great color, excellent dof, great texture, great blacks and whites, overall a geat image.</td>', 'To me, this image stands out among the rest. The dappled light is obvious, but what stands out are the clouds, and the reflection off the water of the clouds, with the jungle in the center giving an eerie feeling of floating among those clouds. Good light, great color, excellent dof, great texture, great blacks and whites, overall a geat image.', '2008-05-23 21:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4720536, 680605, 36006, '<td valign="top">K.I.S.S. is what lighting is about.<br/> <br/>As a lighting tech, I have seen lighting setups that have literally unloaded a 48 foot truck.<br/> <br/>I have always been a fan of the simple, and this meets that criteria</td>', 'K.I.S.S. is what lighting is about. As a lighting tech, I have seen lighting setups that have literally unloaded a 48 foot truck. I have always been a fan of the simple, and this meets that criteria', '2008-05-23 21:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4720537, 678784, 36006, '<td valign="top">even though I clearly see a back light edging the models, and an obvious key, maybe even a fill light or bounce boards, I don''t see any dapples.<br/> <br/>The dogs are distracting and don''t really do much to your image overall.<br/> <br/>come on, shoehorning is not a good thing.</td>', 'even though I clearly see a back light edging the models, and an obvious key, maybe even a fill light or bounce boards, I don''t see any dapples. The dogs are distracting and don''t really do much to your image overall. come on, shoehorning is not a good thing.', '2008-05-23 21:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
