(4720867, 679852, 34938, '<td valign="top">I like the warmth of the light, but I just think the way the shadows have formed on the face is not so flattering...</td>', 'I like the warmth of the light, but I just think the way the shadows have formed on the face is not so flattering...', '2008-05-24 03:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
