(4721032, 680501, 92874, '<td valign="top">I think that if you could have got a face shot of him/her in that light with that great background blur you may have had a winner.</td>', 'I think that if you could have got a face shot of him/her in that light with that great background blur you may have had a winner.', '2008-05-24 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721042, 680621, 3746, '<td valign="top">one of my favourites so far.. nice to see something a bit different.</td>', 'one of my favourites so far.. nice to see something a bit different.', '2008-05-24 07:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721044, 680640, 3746, '<td valign="top">nice... but dappled?</td>', 'nice... but dappled?', '2008-05-24 07:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721045, 678784, 3746, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, but doesn''t really meet the challenge. if you want to explain to me how the shot meets the challenge then I am all ears, but I am known as a DNMC nazi, and in my eyes it does not meet the challenge.. sorry.</td>', 'interesting shot, but doesn''t really meet the challenge. if you want to explain to me how the shot meets the challenge then I am all ears, but I am known as a DNMC nazi, and in my eyes it does not meet the challenge.. sorry.', '2008-05-24 07:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721046, 680641, 3746, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and very dull shot overall..</td>', 'Out of focus and very dull shot overall..', '2008-05-24 08:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721048, 680433, 3746, '<td valign="top">This actually isnt a bad shot, maybe a tad boring, but at least it nails the challenge which is more than 80% of the other shots achieve. Nice POV and DOF.</td>', 'This actually isnt a bad shot, maybe a tad boring, but at least it nails the challenge which is more than 80% of the other shots achieve. Nice POV and DOF.', '2008-05-24 08:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721049, 680422, 3746, '<td valign="top">boring snapshot.. it adheres to the challenge, but doesn''t really set the world on fire through it creativity.</td>', 'boring snapshot.. it adheres to the challenge, but doesn''t really set the world on fire through it creativity.', '2008-05-24 08:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721088, 680192, 47852, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, and the bright and shadow areas are nicely balanced.  The overall composition, however, with your model leaning towards the outside feels unbalanced, as if she is going to fall out of the shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot, and the bright and shadow areas are nicely balanced.  The overall composition, however, with your model leaning towards the outside feels unbalanced, as if she is going to fall out of the shot.', '2008-05-24 08:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721095, 679839, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m usually a fan of the diagonal compositions, however here it makes it feel like the bird is going to fall from the nest.  The lighting is handled wonderfully though, with a nice balance of light and dark.</td>', 'I''m usually a fan of the diagonal compositions, however here it makes it feel like the bird is going to fall from the nest.  The lighting is handled wonderfully though, with a nice balance of light and dark.', '2008-05-24 09:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721106, 680534, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great, fun shot and it''s nice that they all have a smile.  The mix of lighting is handled nicely.  I think it could stand to be a tad brighter, if that is possible without completely losing those highlight areas.  The symmetry here of the trees in the background gives a nice sense of balance, but the whole shot seems slightly tilted counterclockwise.</td>', 'Great, fun shot and it''s nice that they all have a smile.  The mix of lighting is handled nicely.  I think it could stand to be a tad brighter, if that is possible without completely losing those highlight areas.  The symmetry here of the trees in the background gives a nice sense of balance, but the whole shot seems slightly tilted counterclockwise.', '2008-05-24 09:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721108, 680621, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the complimentary colors here and the lighting is very nice.  I think the shot contains so much blue of varying shades, that the blue border is just too much.</td>', 'Love the complimentary colors here and the lighting is very nice.  I think the shot contains so much blue of varying shades, that the blue border is just too much.', '2008-05-24 09:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721115, 680176, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w conversion.  Love the layers of depth from sharp focus to very soft too.</td>', 'Nice b/w conversion.  Love the layers of depth from sharp focus to very soft too.', '2008-05-24 09:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721200, 680571, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice use of wide angle and my god, a photo that meets the challenge..<br/> <br/>I like the vertical lines that create a pattern in the top quarter of the image.. This may not do as well as it deserves, but its a good effort none the less.</td>', 'Nice use of wide angle and my god, a photo that meets the challenge.. I like the vertical lines that create a pattern in the top quarter of the image.. This may not do as well as it deserves, but its a good effort none the less.', '2008-05-24 10:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721203, 680383, 3746, '<td valign="top">Great shot.. The shapes and tones all work well together, I lose a bit of interest to the right hand side, but overall a very solid shot..</td>', 'Great shot.. The shapes and tones all work well together, I lose a bit of interest to the right hand side, but overall a very solid shot..', '2008-05-24 10:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721206, 680537, 3746, '<td valign="top">Very intersting use of light and texture..  Good strong contrast as well. hope this does well for you.. brave entry.</td>', 'Very intersting use of light and texture..  Good strong contrast as well. hope this does well for you.. brave entry.', '2008-05-24 10:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721207, 679914, 3746, '<td valign="top">The soft focus works well here, no doubt some will say its our of focus, but generally a good solid entry.</td>', 'The soft focus works well here, no doubt some will say its our of focus, but generally a good solid entry.', '2008-05-24 10:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721211, 679646, 3746, '<td valign="top">Not a bad effort but it seems you have used a lot of noise reduction on this image, giving the models a very plasticy feel to their skin.</td>', 'Not a bad effort but it seems you have used a lot of noise reduction on this image, giving the models a very plasticy feel to their skin.', '2008-05-24 10:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721212, 680137, 3746, '<td valign="top">You pulled this off pretty well.. shooting underwater isnt the easiest thing in the world (I assume) and its a great idea for dappled light.. There are a few quality issues here, but I will mark you up for trying something different but sticking to the challenge.. I hope this makes the top ten..</td>', 'You pulled this off pretty well.. shooting underwater isnt the easiest thing in the world (I assume) and its a great idea for dappled light.. There are a few quality issues here, but I will mark you up for trying something different but sticking to the challenge.. I hope this makes the top ten..', '2008-05-24 10:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721213, 680215, 73063, '<td valign="top">Wow! Atmosphere or what! The best of the bunch.</td>', 'Wow! Atmosphere or what! The best of the bunch.', '2008-05-24 10:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721214, 680383, 73063, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Like the geometric shapes. Shadows!</td>', 'Fantastic. Like the geometric shapes. Shadows!', '2008-05-24 10:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
