(4721364, 679498, 33161, '<td valign="top">This was a nice entry. I would have liked to see more of her. Positioned her to the right of the frame and took the bright tree out of the right. Nice!</td>', 'This was a nice entry. I would have liked to see more of her. Positioned her to the right of the frame and took the bright tree out of the right. Nice!', '2008-05-24 12:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
