(4721695, 680621, 76335, '<td valign="top">The blue bugs me. I think some color balance adjusting and noise reduction would have helped. The border doesn''t do much either. Otherwise, nicely composed and an intersting dappled light effect.</td>', 'The blue bugs me. I think some color balance adjusting and noise reduction would have helped. The border doesn''t do much either. Otherwise, nicely composed and an intersting dappled light effect.', '2008-05-24 16:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4721696, 680640, 76335, '<td valign="top">This was probably beautiful in real life, but sunsets are hard to process -- especially in Basic Editing. This seems muddy, possibly because of hand shake (did you use a tripod?). Also, it''s not the best example of dappled light. Still, the colors are beautiful, and it is well composed.</td>', 'This was probably beautiful in real life, but sunsets are hard to process -- especially in Basic Editing. This seems muddy, possibly because of hand shake (did you use a tripod?). Also, it''s not the best example of dappled light. Still, the colors are beautiful, and it is well composed.', '2008-05-24 16:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
