(4721759, 680692, 16230, '<td valign="top">I''m an old surfer so this photo grabbed my eye right off. Unfortunately, there are too many technical issues for it to score highly with me.<br/> <br/>The main issues are the tilt of the horizon and the too soft focus. The sun''s reflection on the water is nice. It gives the image a very warm feeling.<br/> <br/>It looks like someone was having fun though, and it does bring back nice memories, so I''ll give it a 7.</td>', 'I''m an old surfer so this photo grabbed my eye right off. Unfortunately, there are too many technical issues for it to score highly with me. The main issues are the tilt of the horizon and the too soft focus. The sun''s reflection on the water is nice. It gives the image a very warm feeling. It looks like someone was having fun though, and it does bring back nice memories, so I''ll give it a 7.', '2008-05-24 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
