(4727453, 679539, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice dappling, contrast and composition.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice dappling, contrast and composition.  Well done!', '2008-05-27 14:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727458, 680079, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern on the lawn!</td>', 'Nice pattern on the lawn!', '2008-05-27 14:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727459, 680057, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nicely-lit portrait highlighting the shape of the face.</td>', 'Nicely-lit portrait highlighting the shape of the face.', '2008-05-27 14:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727472, 679641, 53416, '<td valign="top">Very unique, well composed and with a great background.  Very nice!  (Not sure about the level of dappling though.....)</td>', 'Very unique, well composed and with a great background.  Very nice!  (Not sure about the level of dappling though.....)', '2008-05-27 14:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727476, 678784, 53416, '<td valign="top">Interesting - makes me wonder what''s going on?!  The light in the top left is a bit distracting though, and the light isn''t really dappled enough for my liking.....</td>', 'Interesting - makes me wonder what''s going on?!  The light in the top left is a bit distracting though, and the light isn''t really dappled enough for my liking.....', '2008-05-27 14:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727479, 678739, 53416, '<td valign="top">Could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Could be a bit sharper.', '2008-05-27 14:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727482, 680156, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, lighting and reflections.</td>', 'Nice contrast, lighting and reflections.', '2008-05-27 14:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727483, 680607, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice muted colours and interesting dappling.  I think this might be better if the subject''s face was lit better though...</td>', 'Nice muted colours and interesting dappling.  I think this might be better if the subject''s face was lit better though...', '2008-05-27 15:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727484, 679373, 53416, '<td valign="top">A nice abstract with good contrast and strong lines.  Well done.</td>', 'A nice abstract with good contrast and strong lines.  Well done.', '2008-05-27 15:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727487, 680466, 53416, '<td valign="top">Good composition, great perspective and intersting to look at.  I can see this being quite popular with the less ''mainstream'' viewer.  Well done!</td>', 'Good composition, great perspective and intersting to look at.  I can see this being quite popular with the less ''mainstream'' viewer.  Well done!', '2008-05-27 15:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727488, 679081, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice natural framing with good colour and details.</td>', 'Nice natural framing with good colour and details.', '2008-05-27 15:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727490, 680610, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting ... the landscape format bothered me for a moment (vs portrait mode for a portrait), but the inclusion of more background does make it fit this particular challenge better. I wonder if perhaps a square crop (removed mostly from the right?) would feel better-balanced ...<br/> <br/>I like the lighting, color, focus, expression, catchlights -- I''m not bothered by the small blown-out (on my monitor anyway) spot on the shoulder, but I predict at least a few people will be. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting ... the landscape format bothered me for a moment (vs portrait mode for a portrait), but the inclusion of more background does make it fit this particular challenge better. I wonder if perhaps a square crop (removed mostly from the right?) would feel better-balanced ... I like the lighting, color, focus, expression, catchlights -- I''m not bothered by the small blown-out (on my monitor anyway) spot on the shoulder, but I predict at least a few people will be. Well done.', '2008-05-27 15:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727491, 679374, 53416, '<td valign="top">Ugghhh!!!!  Good composition, depth of field, textures and tone - but not quite dappled enough for me. Over all very nice though!</td>', 'Ugghhh!!!!  Good composition, depth of field, textures and tone - but not quite dappled enough for me. Over all very nice though!', '2008-05-27 15:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727492, 679839, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice dappling, but I''m unsure about the tilted perspective and composition.</td>', 'Nice dappling, but I''m unsure about the tilted perspective and composition.', '2008-05-27 15:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727494, 680319, 53416, '<td valign="top">Nice light - I like how some of the leaves just glow!</td>', 'Nice light - I like how some of the leaves just glow!', '2008-05-27 15:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727495, 680635, 1031, '<td valign="top">Yikes -- can it be 40 years since I was there ... :-(</td>', 'Yikes -- can it be 40 years since I was there ... :-(', '2008-05-27 15:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727498, 680621, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great colour, perspective and composition.  The dappling is also very nice, and its good to see some architecture amongst all the forest pics!<br/> <br/>Unfortunatley I''m not too keen on the border, and running it through Neatimage (or similar) might help with the noise in the sky.  Over all very good though!</td>', 'Great colour, perspective and composition.  The dappling is also very nice, and its good to see some architecture amongst all the forest pics! Unfortunatley I''m not too keen on the border, and running it through Neatimage (or similar) might help with the noise in the sky.  Over all very good though!', '2008-05-27 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727499, 680532, 53416, '<td valign="top">Great colour and contrast.  The blurred background works beautifuly.  Nice!</td>', 'Great colour and contrast.  The blurred background works beautifuly.  Nice!', '2008-05-27 15:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
