(4729781, 680620, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I was there once upon a time.  Lived in New Orleans for a summer.  What I remember?  It stinks.  Literally.  Of urine and alcohol.  I''m sure in spring the scent of southern flowers may provide a bit of a mask to that smell, and perhaps the hurricane washed it out a bit... But it is a town of amazing sights, interesting people, and totally awesome food.  So good memories this brings as well!</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I was there once upon a time.  Lived in New Orleans for a summer.  What I remember?  It stinks.  Literally.  Of urine and alcohol.  I''m sure in spring the scent of southern flowers may provide a bit of a mask to that smell, and perhaps the hurricane washed it out a bit... But it is a town of amazing sights, interesting people, and totally awesome food.  So good memories this brings as well!', '2008-05-28 10:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
