(4732852, 679651, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  The site is between Canon City and Salida in Fremont County, Colorado.  The sky was very cloudy/foggy and the clouds lifting just after sunrise.  No storm just clouds  and shadows on the heavy Colorado snow pack above 12,000 ft.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  The site is between Canon City and Salida in Fremont County, Colorado.  The sky was very cloudy/foggy and the clouds lifting just after sunrise.  No storm just clouds  and shadows on the heavy Colorado snow pack above 12,000 ft.', '2008-05-29 13:56:31.000000', NULL, 0),
