(4735997, 680215, 70661, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Dennis! This is beautiful!!</td>', 'Congrats, Dennis! This is beautiful!!', '2008-05-31 10:10:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4736255, 680176, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yaaaaay congratulations on the very high finish but more importantly the GREAT image.<br/> <br/>Yes it is dappled enough and given the play of light and dark it is amazing that you have got such sharpness throughout the image<br/> <br/>Such a strong balck and white conversion with great tonal ranges.<br/> <br/>I think  ayear ago this would have scored nearer 7 than 6, but unfortunately that is the way that voting seems to have gone recently<br/> <br/>Great great shot</td>', 'Yaaaaay congratulations on the very high finish but more importantly the GREAT image. Yes it is dappled enough and given the play of light and dark it is amazing that you have got such sharpness throughout the image Such a strong balck and white conversion with great tonal ranges. I think  ayear ago this would have scored nearer 7 than 6, but unfortunately that is the way that voting seems to have gone recently Great great shot', '2008-05-31 14:40:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4736261, 680460, 68035, '<td valign="top">hey you...CONGRATULATIONS on your new high score...Totally deserved and I am looking forward to seeing your first six which I reckon could be any time soon<br/> <br/>Great shadow play and a wonderful range of complimentary colours<br/> <br/>Super sharpness (without it being over sharpened) on your daughter a a wonderful gentle blur/bokeh in the background which shows that you got the DOF just right<br/> <br/>Terrific</td>', 'hey you...CONGRATULATIONS on your new high score...Totally deserved and I am looking forward to seeing your first six which I reckon could be any time soon Great shadow play and a wonderful range of complimentary colours Super sharpness (without it being over sharpened) on your daughter a a wonderful gentle blur/bokeh in the background which shows that you got the DOF just right Terrific', '2008-05-31 14:44:31.000000', NULL, 0),
